contentText:
Noah Cyrus posted a loving tribute to late country icon Dolly Parton on Thursday (Aug. 27) in which she noted that she waited a beat to allow older sister, and Parton&#8217;s goddaughter, Miley Cyrus , to share her thoughts first.

